THIRD PARTY COMPONENTS

NS-EEL2 (code/ns-eel2)
    The Nullsoft Expression Evaluator Library, which compiles the per-frame and
    per-pixel equations in MilkDrop presets. Copyright (c) Nullsoft, Inc. Its
    own notice is retained in the source files.

NVIDIA Video Codec SDK headers (code/third_party/nvenc)
    nvEncodeAPI.h, redistributed under the permissive terms in
    code/third_party/nvenc/LICENSE.txt. The encoder itself is loaded at run time
    from the installed NVIDIA driver and is not distributed here.

Microsoft DXSDK.D3DX
    Not included in this repository. Its headers and import library are SDK
    components that Microsoft's terms do not permit republishing, so
    scripts/fetch-deps.ps1 downloads them from Microsoft's own NuGet package at
    build time. The two redistributable DLLs, D3DX9_43.dll and
    D3DCompiler_43.dll, are distributable code and ship inside the installer
    under section 3 of those terms.
